  "sourceRulesPath": "sources/editorial/lost-object-recovery/directions/source-rules.json",
  "entries": [
    {
      "movingLine": 1,
      "changedTrigram": "坎",
      "text": "北方与水边是变坎的传统提示，酒醋之旁也属原典所列。先从确实去过的相应场所问起，照最后真实取放核查，步骤可以朴实些。",
      "sourceRule": "坎",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:15:30.469Z",
      "textSha256": "19ca7396749e9c8eddc365953f3a782a45942655a22d14ca7d3b12fc891fc164"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 2,
      "changedTrigram": "震",
      "text": "方位可参东方，场所见大途、闹市。若原物使用后经过商街或道路，可按实有停留点补问，询查时保留一贯准确的特征描述。",
      "sourceRule": "震",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:15:30.470Z",
      "textSha256": "6408c9c09f904b91971e9bcbbbb384a73f1ef7776d0123e84100508dbd359c32"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 3,
      "changedTrigram": "乾",
      "text": "传统取象落在西北，乾有金石之旁、圆器之中等场所。已有收放记录若能对应，可核原器物旁及容器内部，查证所需权限先问清。",
      "sourceRule": "乾",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:15:30.470Z",
      "textSha256": "4ac5aa47b8e2b33ac0f8493f154f158f14216761f233946c2a84193b6136d143"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 4,
      "changedTrigram": "巽",
      "text": "东南与木器之内是变巽给出的补查方向。若确有一处木柜未能看全，可请原处协助核内部夹放，查物时把不同结果记明。",
      "sourceRule": "巽",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:15:30.470Z",
      "textSha256": "d8ebc052e690f8673a766a96c60507c7bc0dcfa6d1c7175e22a7ccadf7e3d4bc"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 5,
      "changedTrigram": "离",
      "text": "方位取南，明窗、文书旁可供参照。若能依法核查最后的办公或文件收放处，可请掌管者看实际位置，答复仍要落到同一原物。",
      "sourceRule": "离",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:15:30.470Z",
      "textSha256": "c69f3f051984dc6db6ddbf4653aea3c26a246d5125995ef44289db2becd17010"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 6,
      "changedTrigram": "兑",
      "text": "传统方向偏西，兑列泽畔、败垣。可复核实际经过中与此相合的一段，把已查结果和新发现逐项比对，认领前再看独有细节。",
      "sourceRule": "兑",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:15:30.470Z",
      "textSha256": "10f10106e31bde91c3a868bdebc0721c216a6fbe5c30dcf61e1d2eb7ce7ef45e"
    }
  ]
}
